{{!
    @template tiny_muai/prompt_context

    Context block prepended to the review prompt. Either or both of the
    "course" and "module" sections may be missing (e.g. when the editor is
    not in a course/module context).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * defaultpromptcontext - string|null site-wide default context text
    * defaultprompt - string the default review prompt text
    * course - object|null with fullname, shortname, summary, category, category_description
    * module - object|null with type, name, section, section_summary, section_content, restrictions
}}
{{#defaultpromptcontext}}
# Top-level context
{{{.}}}

{{/defaultpromptcontext}}
{{#course}}
# Course details
The course is called "{{{fullname}}}".
{{#summary}}It has the course summary:
{{{.}}}
{{/summary}}
{{#category}}The course is in the top-level category "{{{.}}}".
{{#category_description}}The top-level category has the description:
{{{.}}}
{{/category_description}}
{{/category}}
{{/course}}
{{#module}}

# Module details
The text to review is for a Moodle "{{{type}}}" activity called "{{{name}}}".
{{#section}}It is in the section named "{{{.}}}".
{{/section}}
{{#section_summary}}The section summary is:
{{{.}}}
{{/section_summary}}
{{#additionalcontext}}

## Additional module context
{{{additionalcontext}}}
{{/additionalcontext}}
{{#extraprompt}}

## Extra prompt refinements
{{{extraprompt}}}
{{/extraprompt}}

{{#restrictions}}### Module access restrictions (raw availability JSON): {{{.}}}
{{/restrictions}}

{{#section_content}}

## Section content
The section that the module is in also contains the following labels and books:
{{{.}}}
{{/section_content}}
{{/module}}

{{#previousresponse}}
# Original review
You previously provided the following review:
{{{previousresponse}}}

# Prompt
The user has revised the text based on your review. Please review the revised version, noting what has improved and what still needs attention:
{{{editorcontent}}}
{{/previousresponse}}
{{^previousresponse}}
# Prompt
{{{defaultprompt}}}

Text to review:
{{{editorcontent}}}
{{/previousresponse}}
